      "writtenOn": "2016-06-08T23:34:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we specifically care about the creation date? If created_at and expired were reduced to a single expires_at column (or expired_at... granted, the values may be in the future or past), then you A) would only have to do the math to compute expiration once, B) would not have to update a password as being expired because you could simply filter against the current time, and C) we\u0027d gain the ability to administratively extend or reduce the expiration time frame per password.",
